== The Cellar Stair ==
(Under the tower)

Under the trapdoor a stone stair goes down twenty feet. The air smells
of old oil and wet stone.

At the bottom stands an oak door, swollen in its frame. It is stuck.

Role: fighter

Listen at the door first? [plan]
  1. Listen at the door
  2. Do not listen
> 1

Scratching. Squeaks. Many small feet.

Role: fighter

The door is stuck. What do you do? [final]
  1. Put your shoulder to the door
> 1

The door bursts open with a crack like a dropped plank.

== The Oil Store ==
(The first cellar)

Racks of broken oil jars. The floor is tacky.

Five giant rats, each the size of a cat, lift their heads from the
spill.

Role: fighter

One rat leaps. What do you do? [final]
  1. Hold the doorway and fight
  2. Back up the stair
> 1

You hold the doorway. Only two rats can reach you at a time.

Your blow throws the first one back among the jars. Then the second.

The pack breaks. The rest flee down the far stair.

Role: fighter

The room is yours. What now? [plan]
  1. Search the racks
  2. Go on to the far stair
> 2

************************************************************************
  THE FLOODED STAIR
************************************************************************

A second stair goes down into black water.

As you watch, the water climbs one step, as if the lake took a breath.

The first delve ends here. You row home to tell Maren what moves under
the island.

THE END
Trail: docks > jetty > tower > cellar > store > flooded_stair
r = play again, q = quit > q
Goodbye.
